# Managed by Ansible (homelab/ansible/roles/laptop). Local edits will be overwritten.
# Haswell-ULT graphics (MacBookPro11,1). With the screen off, runtime power management
# keeps trying to put the GPU in its deepest power state (PC8), finds the backlight PWM
# still on, and logs a kernel WARNING with a full stack trace about every 30 seconds.
# Keep this GPU out of runtime suspend instead. Matches this GPU model only, so the
# rule does nothing on other machines. 'bind' runs after the i915 driver has loaded,
# so nothing done during driver setup undoes it.
ACTION=="add|bind", SUBSYSTEM=="pci", ATTR{vendor}=="0x8086", ATTR{device}=="0x0a2e", ATTR{power/control}="on"